    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intergalactic space bastards have invaded Earth's timeline.</strong> It's time to introduce them to shotgun diplomacy. Burn rubber through a medieval apocalypse in this open-world action-survival game inspired by GTA and Vampire Survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diesel Fury</strong> is a 3D action game combining open-world driving with intense third-person combat, survival mechanics, and resource management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Open-World Action</strong><br>Explore a large medieval landscape. Switch instantly between high-speed driving and intense on-foot combat at any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat</strong><br>Third-person gunplay combined with explosive spells and physics driven melee combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nether-Storm</strong><br>Clear landing zones during the day to collect Nether cores, stock up, and survive until the mothership lands and covers the world in darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression System</strong><br>Level up and unlock new abilities with each run. Choose the best upgrades to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Upgrades</strong><br>Permanently unlock new vehicles, better weapons, and devastating spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle-Based Gameplay</strong><br>Drive muscle cars and rugged off-road vehicles to navigate the world quickly and smash through enemies.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intergalactic space bastards have invaded Earth's timeline.</strong> It's time to introduce them to shotgun diplomacy. Burn rubber through a medieval apocalypse in this open-world action-survival game inspired by GTA and Vampire Survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diesel Fury</strong> is a 3D action game combining open-world driving with intense third-person combat, survival mechanics, and resource management.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Open-World Action</strong><br>Explore a large medieval landscape. Switch instantly between high-speed driving and intense on-foot combat at any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat</strong><br>Third-person gunplay combined with explosive spells and physics driven melee combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nether-Storm</strong><br>Clear landing zones during the day to collect Nether cores, stock up, and survive until the mothership lands and covers the world in darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression System</strong><br>Level up and unlock new abilities with each run. Choose the best upgrades to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Upgrades</strong><br>Permanently unlock new vehicles, better weapons, and devastating spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle-Based Gameplay</strong><br>Drive muscle cars and rugged off-road vehicles to navigate the world quickly and smash through enemies.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Diesel Fury is a third-person action roguelite with open-world driving. Step on the gas into the past, unleashing fury through a medieval apocalypse to fight off an intergalactic invasion. Level up each run and unlock new vehicles, weapons, and abilities.",
